{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the harsh winter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898620/extras/6b757a9d53129d598b38cc546a4ba1e2.poster.avif?t=1772824375\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898620/extras/6b757a9d53129d598b38cc546a4ba1e2.webm?t=1772824375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898620/extras/6b757a9d53129d598b38cc546a4ba1e2.mp4?t=1772824375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With new lands come new challenges. You must prepare for the coming winter, store up all the food &amp; water you require, and do what\u2019s needed to keep your settlement alive! With time, perhaps, you can learn to conquer the cold and keep your economy running year-round. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage a complex economy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898620/extras/67dbf1e61636cc45fe25fbab9f2ae6ce.poster.avif?t=1772824375\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898620/extras/67dbf1e61636cc45fe25fbab9f2ae6ce.webm?t=1772824375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898620/extras/67dbf1e61636cc45fe25fbab9f2ae6ce.mp4?t=1772824375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your logistical &amp; economic skills are essential to plan out your settlement successfully. All resources will need to be moved across a complex web of depots to be used by your buildings (there are no magic central inventories here!), and placing your production chains too far apart could be the difference between the settlement\u2019s life &amp; death. You should build new houses to grow your settlement, but beware of hidden costs! If you can\u2019t meet the needs of your population, your settlement may pay the ultimate price! And the threat of the coming winter is always present. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recover forgotten knowledge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898620/extras/6ac2dd0ec23a4ada104b5859fbbcebad.poster.avif?t=1772824375\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898620/extras/6ac2dd0ec23a4ada104b5859fbbcebad.webm?t=1772824375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898620/extras/6ac2dd0ec23a4ada104b5859fbbcebad.mp4?t=1772824375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lost Library of this land is why you settled here. It holds the key to everything you\u2019ve lost, and you will set yourself to the difficult task of learning all its secrets. An enormous research tree of new buildings, tools, efficiencies, resource unlocks, heating systems, work ranges, zones, and more. Everything hinges on your ability to unlock the secrets of the past. Balancing your short-term needs with long-term planning is paramount to your survival. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand &amp; explore new zones</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898620/extras/01e60e30f3d0635ec4df65d33174199d.poster.avif?t=1772824375\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898620/extras/01e60e30f3d0635ec4df65d33174199d.webm?t=1772824375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898620/extras/01e60e30f3d0635ec4df65d33174199d.mp4?t=1772824375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to scour this new land and its different zones, each with its own resources, feel &amp; importance. However, these zones are blocked, and you will first need to contribute resources, risk lives &amp; dedicate yourself to get these ancient gates open. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And more</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore beyond the Vale into the wider World Map - Discover the map one bit at a time, build Outposts to provide luxury resources, deal with bandits and increase your influence with foreign powers and traders!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your settlers will age, get married, have children &amp; pass away.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Impactful weather that commands the entire environment and boosts/hinders crop &amp; tree growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No grids! Be free of technical limits! Build natural looking roads and freely rotate buildings to create the perfect settlement.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2898620?t=1772824375","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2898620?t=1772824375","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898620/3ebc842211b567f73649ade45d4771a3dae8b2f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772824375","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898620/3ebc842211b567f73649ade45d4771a3dae8b2f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772824375","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the harsh winter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898620/extras/6b757a9d53129d598b38cc546a4ba1e2.poster.avif?t=1772824375\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898620/extras/6b757a9d53129d598b38cc546a4ba1e2.webm?t=1772824375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898620/extras/6b757a9d53129d598b38cc546a4ba1e2.mp4?t=1772824375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With new lands come new challenges. You must prepare for the coming winter, store up all the food &amp; water you require, and do what\u2019s needed to keep your settlement alive! With time, perhaps, you can learn to conquer the cold and keep your economy running year-round. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage a complex economy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898620/extras/67dbf1e61636cc45fe25fbab9f2ae6ce.poster.avif?t=1772824375\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898620/extras/67dbf1e61636cc45fe25fbab9f2ae6ce.webm?t=1772824375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898620/extras/67dbf1e61636cc45fe25fbab9f2ae6ce.mp4?t=1772824375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your logistical &amp; economic skills are essential to plan out your settlement successfully. All resources will need to be moved across a complex web of depots to be used by your buildings (there are no magic central inventories here!), and placing your production chains too far apart could be the difference between the settlement\u2019s life &amp; death. You should build new houses to grow your settlement, but beware of hidden costs! If you can\u2019t meet the needs of your population, your settlement may pay the ultimate price! And the threat of the coming winter is always present. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recover forgotten knowledge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898620/extras/6ac2dd0ec23a4ada104b5859fbbcebad.poster.avif?t=1772824375\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898620/extras/6ac2dd0ec23a4ada104b5859fbbcebad.webm?t=1772824375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898620/extras/6ac2dd0ec23a4ada104b5859fbbcebad.mp4?t=1772824375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lost Library of this land is why you settled here. It holds the key to everything you\u2019ve lost, and you will set yourself to the difficult task of learning all its secrets. An enormous research tree of new buildings, tools, efficiencies, resource unlocks, heating systems, work ranges, zones, and more. Everything hinges on your ability to unlock the secrets of the past. Balancing your short-term needs with long-term planning is paramount to your survival. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand &amp; explore new zones</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898620/extras/01e60e30f3d0635ec4df65d33174199d.poster.avif?t=1772824375\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898620/extras/01e60e30f3d0635ec4df65d33174199d.webm?t=1772824375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898620/extras/01e60e30f3d0635ec4df65d33174199d.mp4?t=1772824375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to scour this new land and its different zones, each with its own resources, feel &amp; importance. However, these zones are blocked, and you will first need to contribute resources, risk lives &amp; dedicate yourself to get these ancient gates open. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And more</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore beyond the Vale into the wider World Map - Discover the map one bit at a time, build Outposts to provide luxury resources, deal with bandits and increase your influence with foreign powers and traders!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your settlers will age, get married, have children &amp; pass away.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Impactful weather that commands the entire environment and boosts/hinders crop &amp; tree growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No grids! Be free of technical limits! Build natural looking roads and freely rotate buildings to create the perfect settlement.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Rospeath Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898620/0fa08d39598d3bd937d1005949863a42b142e256/header.jpg?t=1772824375","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<stro